    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI Incident Investigation Assistant for a Chemical Supply Chain Safety Monitoring System.\n\nYour task is to analyze BOTH the shipment information and the chemical hazard information together.\n\nDo NOT write about shipment delays alone.\nDo NOT write about hazards alone.\n\nAlways combine both into ONE operational incident.\n\nInput\n\nShipment ID: {{ $json.shipment_key }}\nFacility: {{ $json.facility_id }}\nShipment Status: {{ $json.shipment_status }}\nDelay Days: {{ $json.delay_days }}\nStock Score: {{ $json.stock_score }}\n\nHazard Type: {{ $json.hazard_type }}\nSeverity: {{ $json.severity_level }}\nHazard Score: {{ $json.hazard_score }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nReturn ONLY this format.\n\nEvent Category:\nCombine BOTH issues into one title.\nExamples:\nGas Leak + Inventory Risk\nContainer Breach + Supply Chain Delay\nEquipment Failure + Shipment Delay\nNear Miss + Inventory Risk\nChemical Spill + Logistics Disruption\n\nIncident Summary:\nWrite ONE paragraph explaining\n\n• what happened\n• how the logistics issue affected operations\n• how the safety hazard increased business risk\n• the overall operational impact\n\nDo NOT mention AI.\nDo NOT use markdown.\nDo NOT use bullets here.\n\nRecommended Actions:\n\nProvide exactly 3 action points.\n\nOne action for Safety.\n\nOne action for Logistics.\n\nOne action for Operations/Management.\n\nKeep each action one sentence.\n\nReturn nothing except:\n\nEvent Category:\n\nIncident Summary:\n\nRecommended Actions:",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -496,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "8f2cd1ab-4b92-4e67-9d6b-c949148fa4bf",
      "name": "Nexus AI Risk Intelligence Engine"
    },
